  <justification>
    <existing>The three fixes are ALL corrections to existing surfaces: (1) task 023 script exists but was never deployed — no new script needed for the 12 columns; (2) `sprk_customerid` requires NEW authoring since it was never on any surface; (3) SKILL.md exists but has drift bugs. Only NEW artifact is `scripts/Add-CustomerIdColumn.ps1`.</existing>
    <extension>Extending existing pattern per Web API PowerShell schema-authoring pattern. Not introducing a new pattern.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Task 186 batch dispatch CANNOT proceed until these three fixes land. Without task 199: (a) live dispatch fails at Step 1f with either Dataverse 400 on missing required fields or silent field-drop on non-existent `sprk_profile`/`sprk_upgrademode` fields; (b) even if placeholder create succeeds, L2 CustomerRunGuard cannot find the row (no `sprk_customerid` alt-key); (c) Step 6a writes wrong setupstatus value (200000004 vs enum 2). Cost is corrupted Cosmos run state + partial Azure resources + manual cleanup.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

